<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  ------				   O/N = ------</p>
<p>	    T/N =  5.12%				    T/N = ------</p>
<p>		   Oct 14, 1996			Oct 11, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.80%	1 month forward =  8.06%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.65%	2 month forward =  7.15%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.62%	3 month forward =  7.74%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  8.11%	4 month forward =  8.44%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.46%	5 month forward =  8.60%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.64%	6 month forward =  8.75%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
